Usage:
  prog [options] <file>
  prog serve [--port=<p>] [-v...]
  prog (add | rm) <name>...
  prog [-tw] -- <rest>...

Options:
  -o FILE --output=FILE  Output file [default: out.txt]
  -q --quiet             Quiet
  --verbose-mode         Verbose
  -t                     T flag
  -w --watch             Watch
  -v                     Verbosity
  --port=<p>             Port [default: 8080]
